
# type(scope): summary in the imperative, 72 characters at most, no full stop
#
# Body (optional): why the change was needed and what it does, wrapped at 72.
# Say what a reader of the diff could not work out alone. For perf commits,
# quote the PERF line before and after.
#
# Types
#   feat      a capability a user or an MCP client can now see
#   bug       a fix for behaviour that was wrong
#   perf      faster or lighter, same behaviour
#   refactor  restructuring with no behaviour change
#   test      tests, fixtures or the verify gate only
#   docs      documentation and templates only
#   build     project config, dependencies, build scripts
#   chore     anything else that does not touch shipped code
#
# Scopes (optional): core, mcp, editor, ai, app, diagrams
#
# One logical change per commit. Each commit should build and pass
# ./Scripts/verify.sh --no-app on its own.
#
# Enable this template once per clone:  git config commit.template .gitmessage
